{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc7b Crafting / Life Sim / Cooking Tycoon \ud83c\udf73</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588570/extras/668ec642424a032a33100829c65840d2.avif?t=1773661471\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588570/extras_big/668ec642424a032a33100829c65840d2.avif?t=1773661471 width=800 height=521 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Haunted Delivery Restaurant</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588570/extras/eb49b00a47cbb051d7e2c09ab8c0b4dc.poster.avif?t=1773661471\" width=800 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588570/extras/eb49b00a47cbb051d7e2c09ab8c0b4dc.webm?t=1773661471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playful, picky, and sometimes downright indecisive\u2014ghost customers are never easy to please. Choose and deliver meals that satisfy their mysterious cravings\u2026 if you can figure them out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simulation &amp; Co-op Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588570/extras/3d5769b907835154a4261c8ff87a3bd1.poster.avif?t=1773661471\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588570/extras/3d5769b907835154a4261c8ff87a3bd1.webm?t=1773661471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just about taking orders and cooking. You\u2019ll need to <strong>explore, hunt, farm, forage, mine, and chop wood</strong> to gather ingredients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds like a lot? Why not team up with friends? Just remember\u2014the kitchen only fits <strong>four</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelite Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588570/extras/0577498e8e3ff63705f8ccae3b6cff9e.poster.avif?t=1773661471\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588570/extras/0577498e8e3ff63705f8ccae3b6cff9e.webm?t=1773661471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunted forest where <strong>poltergeists run wild and the world shifts daily</strong>\u2014nothing stays the same for long. Explore ever-changing regions, face unexpected surprises, and don\u2019t be alarmed if a pumpkin dog suddenly turns into a ghost. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Friendship &amp; Rivalry</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588570/extras/11e32fb8330a280b068cd0f09d4169ec.poster.avif?t=1773661471\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588570/extras/11e32fb8330a280b068cd0f09d4169ec.webm?t=1773661471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bankruptcy on your first day?!</strong> The rival shop\u2019s witch offers you a high-stakes bet\u2014with souls on the line. You say you're not scared because you're already dead? <strong>Think again.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3588570?t=1773661471","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588570/5341c803fb1dd74d738efae4cd004e333af0eba9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773661471","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588570/c9f18a923ecef4d2184770bab0cfbe049a5c02fc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773661471","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588570/c9f18a923ecef4d2184770bab0cfbe049a5c02fc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773661471","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc7b Crafting / Life Sim / Cooking Tycoon \ud83c\udf73</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588570/extras/668ec642424a032a33100829c65840d2.avif?t=1773661471\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588570/extras_big/668ec642424a032a33100829c65840d2.avif?t=1773661471 width=800 height=521 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Haunted Delivery Restaurant</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588570/extras/eb49b00a47cbb051d7e2c09ab8c0b4dc.poster.avif?t=1773661471\" width=800 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588570/extras/eb49b00a47cbb051d7e2c09ab8c0b4dc.webm?t=1773661471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></spa